<trk><name>LOT 4 - OCT P-1616 (Allan V. Inocalla) 15.2 ha</name><desc>15.2069 has. Tie N60°01'W 3,508.83 m from BLBM No.1 Batobalani, DENR-confirmed (SMD-SCS-INC-26-172). Closure 0.07 m. Accuracy +/-20-30 m absolute.</desc><extensions><gpx_style:line><gpx_style:color>00C000</gpx_style:color><gpx_style:width>5</gpx_style:width></gpx_style:line></extensions><trkseg><trkpt lat="14.249210" lon="122.711924"/><trkpt lat="14.250592" lon="122.712017"/><trkpt lat="14.248476" lon="122.712577"/><trkpt lat="14.247727" lon="122.714503"/><trkpt lat="14.245912" lon="122.712449"/><trkpt lat="14.246198" lon="122.710968"/><trkpt lat="14.245439" lon="122.709553"/><trkpt lat="14.247186" lon="122.709333"/><trkpt lat="14.247894" lon="122.708962"/><trkpt lat="14.247975" lon="122.708599"/><trkpt lat="14.247815" lon="122.708093"/><trkpt lat="14.248495" lon="122.708028"/><trkpt lat="14.248490" lon="122.709930"/><trkpt lat="14.249009" lon="122.710740"/><trkpt lat="14.248575" lon="122.711930"/><trkpt lat="14.249210" lon="122.711924"/></trkseg></trk>
<trk><name>T-2194 - GRACESEN PLANT LOT 13.4 ha</name><desc>13.3690 has. Tie N57°49'W 3,579.00 m from BLBM No.1; closure 0.09 m. Gracesen plant (ECC-RO5-1203-0045) is on this lot per MPDC certification May 20 2014 (ARP GR-2008-FF-08-008-00541); exact plant point not in any document.</desc><extensions><gpx_style:line><gpx_style:color>FF8800</gpx_style:color><gpx_style:width>5</gpx_style:width></gpx_style:line></extensions><trkseg><trkpt lat="14.250588" lon="122.712018"/><trkpt lat="14.250227" lon="122.709760"/><trkpt lat="14.250753" lon="122.708425"/><trkpt lat="14.251367" lon="122.708983"/><trkpt lat="14.251582" lon="122.708666"/><trkpt lat="14.253032" lon="122.709282"/><trkpt lat="14.253314" lon="122.709187"/><trkpt lat="14.254100" lon="122.709469"/><trkpt lat="14.252740" lon="122.713165"/><trkpt lat="14.252336" lon="122.713024"/><trkpt lat="14.252328" lon="122.712914"/><trkpt lat="14.252182" lon="122.712596"/><trkpt lat="14.251859" lon="122.712577"/><trkpt lat="14.251551" lon="122.712235"/><trkpt lat="14.251254" lon="122.712220"/><trkpt lat="14.250994" lon="122.712093"/><trkpt lat="14.250588" lon="122.712018"/></trkseg></trk>
